# ::tok "The delay in publishing the minutes harms the transparency of the decisions; as a result, the ability of proposers – health organizations and pharmaceutical companies – to submit revised requests promptly and relevantly, after receiving feedback from the previous round may be compromised, so they could analyze the reasons for their proposals' rejection, improve and adjust their suggestions, and reevaluate their feasibility for acceptance in the next round," noted the State Comptroller in the report.
